WEBVTT

00:23:29.205 --> 00:23:35.089
Public Program, Paris, France, 19850424

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:39.805
I bow to all the seekers of truth.

00:23:45.081 --> 00:23:50.653
The day before, I told you, that traditionally,

00:23:50.853 --> 00:23:59.875
one has to understand what a seeker has to find out.

00:24:08.987 --> 00:24:15.081
He has to find out himself, his own Spirit

00:24:18.415 --> 00:24:27.509
The idea of having some sort of a new venture into the style of seeking

00:24:27.709 --> 00:24:33.840
comes because people want to make money out of you.

00:24:48.831 --> 00:24:54.762
But the one who is the true master or the Satguru

00:24:54.962 --> 00:25:00.905
will tell you that you have to seek your Self.

00:25:11.090 --> 00:25:15.185
He has no interest in what you are

00:25:15.385 --> 00:25:22.385
nor he has any interest in what you can give him.

00:25:32.943 --> 00:25:36.048
Because he stands on the giving end

00:25:36.248 --> 00:25:38.805
and he cannot receive even if he wants to,

00:25:39.005 --> 00:25:43.807
he cannot receive by his own nature.

00:25:51.855 --> 00:25:56.083
And so, also, he does not want because by his nature,

00:25:56.283 --> 00:26:01.635
he is compelled, just to give.

00:26:12.192 --> 00:26:20.420
Even if you try to please such a guru, by giving him something,

00:26:20.620 --> 00:26:26.174
he will say: ”I’m sorry, you’d better have it to yourself”.

00:26:41.608 --> 00:26:46.341
We had a very great saint in Maharashtra called Tukaram.

00:26:50.409 --> 00:26:56.487
And we had a very enlighten king called Shivaji.

00:27:02.438 --> 00:27:06.673
And when he heard about Tukaram and found out about him,

00:27:06.873 --> 00:27:11.791
he took lots of ornaments for his wife and things for his children

00:27:11.991 --> 00:27:18.528
and for his household and went to see him.

00:27:35.062 --> 00:27:39.604
So the saint Tukaram was not in the house and the wife was very happy,

00:27:39.805 --> 00:27:43.868
she took the ornaments and the children took the things and they were very happy

00:27:44.068 --> 00:27:49.959
that they got all these things from the king Shivaji himself.

00:28:07.113 --> 00:28:11.841
Tukaram came home and he saw this and Shivaji was there.

00:28:12.064 --> 00:28:20.468
So he said to Shivaji: "Sir, these are meant for the queens and not for us.”

00:28:22.295 --> 00:28:28.823
Meant for the queen and not for us, ornaments.

00:28:40.643 --> 00:28:45.893
And he returned everything back to Tukaram- to Shivaji.

00:28:48.070 --> 00:28:51.143
So we have many stories of this kind

00:28:51.343 --> 00:28:55.493
to tell us those who have interest in your Spirit

00:28:55.693 --> 00:29:00.505
and your ascent are the true teachers.

00:29:14.079 --> 00:29:17.848
Kundalini has been described fourteen thousand years back

00:29:18.048 --> 00:29:24.538
by a great poet called Markandeya in our country.

00:29:30.809 --> 00:29:34.008
I told you the other day that in Koran it is described

00:29:34.208 --> 00:29:38.904
as ‘asas’ [base, foundation] and in Granth Sahib as "Shruti” [revelation]

00:29:39.104 --> 00:29:46.110
and in the Bible as the Holy Ghost.

00:30:01.996 --> 00:30:06.983
In the Zen system also, it is described of the Zen system of Bodhidharma,

00:30:07.183 --> 00:30:11.085
it is described and also Lao-Tse has described it.

00:30:11.285 --> 00:30:16.480
Every one of them has described it.

00:30:30.289 --> 00:30:34.800
Now, this Kundalini is actually the pure desire within us,

00:30:35.000 --> 00:30:40.319
is the energy of pure desire.

00:30:45.622 --> 00:30:50.451
We have another one on the left-hand side of ourselves,

00:30:50.651 --> 00:30:58.135
which you see here in the blue colour, is the power of desire.

00:31:08.428 --> 00:31:14.311
And on the right-hand side is the power of action.

00:31:17.527 --> 00:31:21.389
The left-hand side one is called as Ida Nadi

00:31:21.589 --> 00:31:26.509
and the right side as the Pingala Nadi.

00:31:32.765 --> 00:31:40.949
And the centre one is called as Sushumna Nadi, is the channel of Sushumna.

00:31:43.850 --> 00:31:49.694
So the left side caters to our past, to our conditioning.

00:31:55.114 --> 00:31:59.592
Aand with the activity of our conditionings and desires,

00:31:59.792 --> 00:32:03.818
we accumulate within us an institution which we call

00:32:04.018 --> 00:32:10.367
as "mana” in Sanskrit and "superego” in the English language.

00:32:31.673 --> 00:32:34.216
There are some seats here in front also, please.

00:32:34.416 --> 00:32:38.196
You can come here in front there are some seats, please.

00:32:38.396 --> 00:32:43.481
Please, there are seats here.

00:32:54.259 --> 00:32:58.329
Please come, there are some seats here.

00:33:02.205 --> 00:33:06.068
That side, you can come now, this side, there are some seats, please.

00:33:06.268 --> 00:33:10.196
This side, this side.

00:33:16.008 --> 00:33:19.464
Please, look out, there are some seats here. Come in front, yes?

00:33:19.664 --> 00:33:24.301
Those who want to come?

00:33:38.030 --> 00:33:46.306
Now, the power of pure desire, which is the Kundalini,

00:33:46.506 --> 00:33:54.512
which is in the triangular bone of sacrum, gives us this ascent.

00:34:12.860 --> 00:34:16.080
This is the reflection of the Holy Ghost,

00:34:16.280 --> 00:34:22.139
is the power we call as Adi Shakti, the Primordial Mother.

00:34:31.338 --> 00:34:38.502
And the reflection of God Almighty is in our heart, which is the Spirit.

00:34:45.157 --> 00:34:50.619
When the union takes places, then we say "Yoga” has happened

00:34:50.819 --> 00:34:56.387
means the union, "Yoga” also means the union.

00:35:04.940 --> 00:35:11.362
Thus, our attention becomes enlightened by the Spirit.

00:35:16.852 --> 00:35:20.649
When our attention is enlightened by the Spirit,

00:35:20.849 --> 00:35:24.415
then we become, I say again we become,

00:35:24.615 --> 00:35:26.720
it’s not a mental projection or anything,

00:35:26.920 --> 00:35:33.066
but actually you become collectively conscious.

00:35:44.882 --> 00:35:52.770
That means you start feeling your inner Self,

00:35:52.970 --> 00:35:58.340
your centres, your nadhis on your fingertips

00:35:58.540 --> 00:36:03.152
and that of others as well.

00:36:19.148 --> 00:36:22.729
So first, when the Kundalini awakens,

00:36:22.929 --> 00:36:26.157
it gives the first state called Nirvichara Samadhi,

00:36:26.357 --> 00:36:32.076
means the one where you become thoughtlessly aware.

00:36:42.360 --> 00:36:46.293
Now, this is the energy of pure,

00:36:46.493 --> 00:36:52.820
again I say, the pure and the holy desire within us.

00:36:59.990 --> 00:37:04.138
All other desires are impure.

00:37:05.326 --> 00:37:09.944
That’s why you must have seen, that according to economics,

00:37:10.144 --> 00:37:16.478
the wants, in general, are not satiable, in particular, they are.

00:37:36.901 --> 00:37:40.678
Because you want to have something say, you want to have a car,

00:37:40.878 --> 00:37:43.582
then when you get the car, you want to have a house,

00:37:43.782 --> 00:37:46.113
then you get a house you want to have something else,

00:37:46.313 --> 00:37:50.117
you go on shifting from one desire to another, to another desire.

00:37:50.317 --> 00:37:55.575
Because that desire is not satisfying.

00:38:09.716 --> 00:38:14.396
So, this pure Energy within us of our holy desire

00:38:14.596 --> 00:38:19.029
is one that is to be one with the Divine,

00:38:19.229 --> 00:38:24.250
with the All-pervading Power of God.

00:38:33.437 --> 00:38:37.026
And unless and until this Desire is awaken within us

00:38:37.226 --> 00:38:45.234
through the spontaneous happening of the living force of the living God,

00:38:45.434 --> 00:38:50.377
you cannot get your Realization.

00:39:06.951 --> 00:39:13.785
It is "sahaja”, it means born with you.

00:39:16.754 --> 00:39:21.369
It also means: it is spontaneous.

00:39:24.056 --> 00:39:31.077
So the right to become one with the Divine is born with us.

00:39:36.614 --> 00:39:39.239
It is built in within our being,

00:39:39.440 --> 00:39:44.657
the way it is shown here in a subtle way.

00:39:49.386 --> 00:39:53.746
All these centres are created within us in the different stages

00:39:53.946 --> 00:39:57.560
of our evolution, which are being strengthened

00:39:57.760 --> 00:40:05.009
by the different Incarnations of the Prophets and of the other Incarnations

00:40:05.209 --> 00:40:12.480
that they have made this part available to us for our ascent.

00:40:37.588 --> 00:40:44.476
Now, the problem is that in this world, there are many people

00:40:44.676 --> 00:40:51.197
who are not yet feeling this urge to be the Spirit.

00:41:02.578 --> 00:41:09.845
But there are still millions who are feeling that there is something beyond,

00:41:10.045 --> 00:41:15.092
they are the special category of the people.

00:41:34.952 --> 00:41:42.227
So as William Blake has said that: "Men of God have to become prophets,

00:41:42.427 --> 00:41:50.398
and they will have the power to make other prophets”, that is the time today.

00:42:06.859 --> 00:42:11.142
All of them have prophesized about these special times,

00:42:11.342 --> 00:42:14.236
even Mahomed Sahib has said it very clearly:

00:42:14.436 --> 00:42:19.606
"at the time of Resurrection, your hands will speak”.

00:42:34.992 --> 00:42:41.701
But people don’t talk of resurrection, they just talk of the Doomsday.

00:42:48.012 --> 00:42:55.075
He was the same principal as other Prophets were like Abraham, Moses,

00:42:55.275 --> 00:43:03.736
Nanaka, Janaka, all of them are the same principal of Primordial Master.

00:43:22.607 --> 00:43:30.174
They tried to teach you the balance of life which is called as dharma.

00:43:35.115 --> 00:43:38.258
If you do not have the dharma within you -

00:43:38.458 --> 00:43:43.428
dharma is the valency of man, is ten valences he has got,

00:43:43.628 --> 00:43:47.974
while the matter has got only eight, animals nine

00:43:48.174 --> 00:43:53.260
and the human beings have ten valences.

00:44:07.013 --> 00:44:10.149
So there has been principal ten Incarnations

00:44:10.349 --> 00:44:16.441
and those who came on this Earth to teach us the balance.

00:44:28.110 --> 00:44:34.596
Then they were other Incarnations on this Earth like Krishna, Rama

00:44:34.796 --> 00:44:43.059
and Christ who taught us that we have to seek the life eternal.

00:44:56.469 --> 00:44:59.761
This Kundalini rest in the triangular bone which is sacrum,

00:44:59.961 --> 00:45:05.447
meaning sacred, that means the Greek knew that this,

00:45:05.647 --> 00:45:10.436
this one was a sacred place.

00:45:32.036 --> 00:45:36.039
But in the last hundred years, lots of funny people have come around

00:45:36.239 --> 00:45:38.800
and giving very funny ideas even about Kundalini

00:45:39.000 --> 00:45:44.174
which is not written anywhere in the Shastras.

00:46:03.847 --> 00:46:09.613
This Kundalini is your individual Mother, and how can She trouble you?

00:46:09.813 --> 00:46:12.129
When your mother, physical mother gave you birth,

00:46:12.329 --> 00:46:16.714
she took up all the trouble upon herself.

00:46:34.397 --> 00:46:38.200
This kundalini passes through the six centres that why it’s called as

00:46:38.400 --> 00:46:40.888
"sat chakra bhedana” [six chakra penetration] means there are six centres

00:46:41.088 --> 00:46:48.250
it pierces through. And the seventh one is placed under the Kundalini.

00:47:04.190 --> 00:47:08.529
The seventh one is the – or we can call it the first one –

00:47:08.729 --> 00:47:13.196
is the centre of innocence within us.

00:47:19.404 --> 00:47:25.986
Now, the ascent of the Kundalini when it takes place,

00:47:26.186 --> 00:47:29.640
the seat of the Spirit is on top of your head

00:47:29.840 --> 00:47:32.968
and that’s why you get your enlightenment

00:47:33.168 --> 00:47:37.786
when the Kundalini touches the seat of the Spirit.

00:47:37.986 --> 00:47:43.749
It’s the seat or called as pita in Sanskrit language, is called pith.

00:48:14.543 --> 00:48:17.528
As a result of this happening, the first thing you feel

00:48:17.728 --> 00:48:23.234
is the cool breeze coming out of your head.

00:48:30.193 --> 00:48:33.884
You also start feeling the cool breeze all around you,

00:48:34.084 --> 00:48:41.527
because this is the All-pervading Power of God which is formless.

00:48:51.072 --> 00:48:54.565
When you start feeling that energy for the first time,

00:48:54.765 --> 00:49:00.804
then you have to know what it is, how to use it, how to work it out.

00:49:12.353 --> 00:49:15.615
The another meaning of the word "yoga”, also means "yukti”,

00:49:15.815 --> 00:49:22.451
means the deftness, deftness, how to you use the All-pervading Power of God,

00:49:22.651 --> 00:49:28.250
how to decode, how to manifest.

00:49:47.978 --> 00:49:54.699
Now the nature of the Spirit is that, when it comes into your attention,

00:49:54.899 --> 00:50:00.733
first of all, your brain gets enlightened with the truth.

00:50:11.801 --> 00:50:18.218
That is, you go to a person and he says he is a very great guru,

00:50:18.418 --> 00:50:23.128
you don’t know whether he is a real or not, you cannot make it out.

00:50:23.328 --> 00:50:27.243
But because you have got these cool vibrations,

00:50:27.443 --> 00:50:31.485
you can feel the cool vibrations from a Sat Guru

00:50:31.685 --> 00:50:36.973
and from a bad one you might even get some blisters.

00:51:08.029 --> 00:51:12.891
Then if you ask any fundamental question, like: "Is there God?”

00:51:13.091 --> 00:51:15.560
You start getting tremendous cool breeze in the hand,

00:51:15.760 --> 00:51:19.762
like a computer, you start acting.

00:51:33.914 --> 00:51:39.027
I had a disciple, I shouldn’t say, disciple, I call them my children,

00:51:39.227 --> 00:51:44.235
in the beginning, he was an English man very sceptical about everything.

00:51:44.436 --> 00:51:48.211
He said that: "Mother, how do you say there is telecommunication of God

00:51:48.411 --> 00:51:52.653
that is very efficient?”

00:52:19.334 --> 00:52:21.640
So I said: "All right, what do you want to find out?”

00:52:21.840 --> 00:52:25.164
He said: "I want to find out about my father who is in Scotland

00:52:25.364 --> 00:52:30.221
because he’s not talked to me since long.”

00:52:41.378 --> 00:52:44.693
So I said: "All right, you put your hands like this and ask in your heart:

00:52:44.893 --> 00:52:49.070
‘How is my father?'”

00:52:55.008 --> 00:53:02.437
And he started feeling a burning sensation here, in this part.

00:53:08.909 --> 00:53:15.024
Now, this is the Vishuddhi chakra here.

00:53:19.703 --> 00:53:22.643
And this portion, if it is burning, this is the father’s,

00:53:22.843 --> 00:53:27.827
all father’s chakra, chakras or the centres.

00:53:32.043 --> 00:53:39.511
If it is burning that means that your father must be down with bronchitis.

00:53:48.816 --> 00:53:54.353
So he doubted it and he telephoned to his father.

00:54:01.100 --> 00:54:06.016
And he asked his mother

00:54:06.216 --> 00:54:14.015
and the mother said that: "Your father is down with a very bad bronchitis.”

00:54:23.208 --> 00:54:27.985
But he was so amazed that afterwards he never started doubting

00:54:28.185 --> 00:54:33.284
the presence of God within himself.

00:54:40.205 --> 00:54:47.460
When you start knowing the truth, you do not accept untruth and falsehood.

00:54:53.461 --> 00:54:56.852
You become so powerful that you stand on that truth

00:54:57.052 --> 00:55:01.599
and you are not afraid of anything.

00:55:07.284 --> 00:55:11.512
In 1970, I spoke about all these false gurus,

00:55:11.712 --> 00:55:16.556
openly with their names, in India.

00:55:21.421 --> 00:55:25.280
And all the newspapers published it.

00:55:26.358 --> 00:55:31.918
And people were worried that these people will come and shoot me down.

00:55:38.604 --> 00:55:42.497
And I criticized all the cults and all kinds of sects

00:55:42.697 --> 00:55:50.659
but none of them, even till today, have tried to do anything to Me.

00:56:06.653 --> 00:56:11.586
Come here, there are some seats here, please.

00:56:13.547 --> 00:56:17.027
So when you stand on the truth like Christ,

00:56:17.227 --> 00:56:19.736
when he stood on the truth,

00:56:19.936 --> 00:56:25.791
He saw a prostitute being stoned by people,

00:56:25.991 --> 00:56:28.953
and a person like Christ, a saint,

00:56:29.153 --> 00:56:33.801
has nothing to do with a prostitute as such.

00:56:55.521 --> 00:56:58.188
But He said that: "Those who have not committed any sin

00:56:58.388 --> 00:57:03.683
can throw the stone at me!” At himself!

00:57:12.158 --> 00:57:16.301
And nobody threw stones.

00:57:16.501 --> 00:57:21.624
This courage comes because you are standing on the truth.

00:57:26.911 --> 00:57:29.873
So, the second thing that happens to you

00:57:30.073 --> 00:57:35.580
is that you become a very peaceful personality.

00:57:42.111 --> 00:57:46.680
Because you start witnessing everything.

00:57:51.516 --> 00:57:55.642
Like we have got thoughts within us which rises up and falls down,

00:57:55.842 --> 00:58:00.254
another thought rises and falls down.

00:58:08.119 --> 00:58:11.505
Now, when these thoughts rise, in between them,

00:58:11.705 --> 00:58:16.673
is a little space which is the present.

00:58:22.828 --> 00:58:28.600
And when the Kundalini rises, she puts you in the state of the present

00:58:28.800 --> 00:58:34.799
where you see the future and the past, but you are in the present.

00:58:42.775 --> 00:58:48.775
So you watch the whole thing like a drama, like a play.

00:58:53.827 --> 00:58:57.800
So you become a personality which is peaceful within yourself

00:58:58.000 --> 00:59:02.520
whatever maybe the turmoil outside.

00:59:07.697 --> 00:59:11.068
Supposing you are standing in the water, you are afraid of the waves.

00:59:11.268 --> 00:59:14.755
But supposing you get onto a boat, you can enjoy the waves,

00:59:14.955 --> 00:59:19.856
you can see it, without getting involved into it.

00:59:36.375 --> 00:59:42.951
This state is what we need today.

00:59:46.779 --> 00:59:50.796
We talk of peace mission, these peace conferences

00:59:50.996 --> 00:59:54.989
and peace delegation, they have not peace within themselves,

00:59:55.189 --> 01:00:00.064
what peace are they going to create?

01:00:19.940 --> 01:00:24.186
And this peace is extremely powerful, it does not aggress anyone

01:00:24.386 --> 01:00:29.618
and does not take any aggression upon itself.

01:00:45.309 --> 01:00:50.007
And that sort of a personality you develop, you are so relaxed

01:00:50.207 --> 01:01:00.994
and doing everything with such dynamism, but don’t get upset and you see the fullness of your action.

01:01:22.489 --> 01:01:26.912
As a result of Self-realization, you become a pure personality,

01:01:27.112 --> 01:01:32.659
your attention becomes purified.

01:01:40.829 --> 01:01:45.197
Because of our conditioning, we have developed an attention

01:01:45.397 --> 01:01:49.803
that is full of greed and lust.

01:01:59.745 --> 01:02:04.889
But such a person develops that kind of an innocence in the eyes

01:02:05.089 --> 01:02:11.121
that if such a person even looks at somebody, he can purify that person,

01:02:11.321 --> 01:02:19.117
he can cure that person, he can raise the Kundalini, just with a glance.

01:02:39.906 --> 01:02:42.393
When the Grace of God starts flowing through your being,

01:02:42.593 --> 01:02:46.550
you become extremely compassionate, extremely compassionate,

01:02:46.750 --> 01:02:53.274
but the compassion that does not speak, the compassion that works.

01:03:04.857 --> 01:03:07.365
You get the discrete compassion,

01:03:07.566 --> 01:03:10.190
which tells you where you have to be compassionate

01:03:10.391 --> 01:03:16.724
and where you have to be firm and where you have to be denied.

01:03:31.071 --> 01:03:34.660
You get over all your temptations and the weakness of your mind,

01:03:34.860 --> 01:03:44.734
and you get completely integrated, your mind and your emotions and your physical body,

01:03:44.935 --> 01:03:52.612
everything integrates beautifully and you live in complete concord with yourself.

01:04:11.156 --> 01:04:19.271
I have already told you that your attention becomes collectively conscious

01:04:23.146 --> 01:04:26.766
and you become a very dynamic person,

01:04:26.966 --> 01:04:32.237
understanding so many things which you never saw.

01:04:38.040 --> 01:04:44.446
And the last of all, you feel the joy of your Spirit.

01:04:51.241 --> 01:04:56.046
You live in the joy of your Spirit.

01:04:56.246 --> 01:05:03.033
You look at least twenty years younger sometimes than what your age is.

01:05:08.299 --> 01:05:14.742
Your face shines with the brilliance of the Kundalini.

01:05:19.326 --> 01:05:23.946
You give so much to the world that first time you start even giving

01:05:24.146 --> 01:05:31.417
to the nature, establishing the ecological balance.

01:05:45.038 --> 01:05:48.267
There is one scientist in Austria, who is a Sahaja Yogi,

01:05:48.467 --> 01:05:57.086
has experimented with the sugarcane, in Austria,

01:05:57.286 --> 01:06:03.427
who is a UN advisor to various countries

01:06:03.627 --> 01:06:10.464
and he was amazed that without giving any manure, without giving anything special,

01:06:10.664 --> 01:06:19.204
he could give energy to the plants in such a manner

01:06:19.404 --> 01:06:24.999
that they grew ten times more, ten times more than the normal ones!

01:06:25.199 --> 01:06:30.058
And he didn’t know how to control the heights.

01:06:33.486 --> 01:06:40.220
In the quantity, ten times and the height was at least double.

01:07:15.230 --> 01:07:20.397
The hybrid seeds that we use are not needed anymore

01:07:20.597 --> 01:07:23.480
because they cannot reproduce and you become slave

01:07:23.680 --> 01:07:25.889
of some organizations for that.

01:07:26.089 --> 01:07:31.255
But in this, when you vibrate the seeds, which are old seeds,

01:07:31.455 --> 01:07:35.701
become regenerated and you can reuse them very well,

01:07:35.901 --> 01:07:40.916
producing very high-class products.

01:08:21.442 --> 01:08:28.397
Thus, you enter into the Kingdom of God, where all that is available at His command,

01:08:28.597 --> 01:08:33.558
your compassionate Father gives you all the help that you want.

01:08:33.758 --> 01:08:40.201
If you ask the Sahaja Yogis here, they will tell you how much they are blessed.

01:08:59.957 --> 01:09:04.238
I’m not a guru, as I told you before, I’m a Mother

01:09:04.438 --> 01:09:11.621
and a mother has a greater joy in giving everything that she has to her children.

01:09:20.621 --> 01:09:23.757
Her pride is in her children and she wants her children to grow,

01:09:23.957 --> 01:09:28.326
not that she becomes sort of a person who is growing

01:09:28.526 --> 01:09:34.760
and thriving on the children, but the children thrive on the mother.

01:09:45.537 --> 01:09:49.072
Thus, I have a message for you, for Paris,

01:09:49.272 --> 01:09:55.901
that please try listen to to your innate heart, try to become the Spirit.

01:09:56.101 --> 01:10:03.852
There is no circus about it, there is no short method or some sort of stupid things.

01:10:04.052 --> 01:10:08.046
You cannot pay for it. It is something, it is a living process

01:10:08.246 --> 01:10:12.745
and it has to take within yourself.

01:10:47.410 --> 01:10:50.012
So you have to understand one more thing

01:10:50.212 --> 01:10:54.817
that even if you get your Realization, you may feel on top of the world,

01:10:55.017 --> 01:10:58.010
but that doesn’t mean that you have achieved

01:10:58.210 --> 01:11:01.752
the complete establishment of your Realization.

01:11:01.952 --> 01:11:06.422
For that, you have to come to our centre to know about it,

01:11:06.622 --> 01:11:11.489
for which you don’t have to pay anything whatsoever.

01:11:49.513 --> 01:11:53.142
Only in Paris, they found out that people were taking

01:11:53.342 --> 01:11:57.616
a very great advantage of other Sahaja Yogis,

01:11:57.816 --> 01:12:00.827
so they decided that those who come, have to pay

01:12:01.027 --> 01:12:04.952
a very little amount for the paper and all these things that they do

01:12:05.152 --> 01:12:09.583
and for the hall so that they feel that they have to pay a little bit,

01:12:09.783 --> 01:12:16.789
I don’t know that according to them it works out better with the French people.

01:12:45.138 --> 01:12:47.385
But I don’t take any money whatsoever.

01:12:47.586 --> 01:12:50.099
They will see all the accounts themselves, what is happening

01:12:50.299 --> 01:12:53.232
with the money that you give, which is a very, very small amount.

01:12:53.432 --> 01:12:55.920
But that’s what they have found, it has to be otherwise we gather

01:12:56.121 --> 01:13:00.649
all kinds of beggars around us.

01:13:31.853 --> 01:13:34.724
It’s a sad thing they have to do it in Paris,

01:13:34.924 --> 01:13:38.349
so with a great deliberation, I allowed them all right,

01:13:38.549 --> 01:13:44.018
because they’re finding that for everything like these things and all that,

01:13:44.219 --> 01:13:47.363
for tapes and all that, all the Sahaja Yogis were paying the money

01:13:47.563 --> 01:13:51.228
and those who were coming were just coming for eating food and enjoying themselves,

01:13:51.429 --> 01:13:55.935
it was a very sad thing.

01:14:23.917 --> 01:14:29.121
In my own experience, I feel Paris is a very important and [inaudible] place.

01:14:29.321 --> 01:14:31.680
If we can establish Sahaja Yoga in Paris,

01:14:31.880 --> 01:14:36.765
we may be able to save the world much faster.

01:14:50.745 --> 01:14:54.013
But I feel that people are sometimes very casual

01:14:54.213 --> 01:14:58.793
and they do not understand their own importance and the importance of their Spirit

01:14:58.994 --> 01:15:04.995
and the importance of their life, that it must have some meaning.

01:15:23.016 --> 01:15:28.000
If you are a true seeker, then I’m sure you will achieve that

01:15:28.200 --> 01:15:33.982
which is the highest. Nothing more is needed after.

01:15:45.165 --> 01:15:48.731
I will ask you to ask Me some questions for a short time.

01:15:48.931 --> 01:15:52.547
But please do not go on about other gurus or anything.

01:15:52.747 --> 01:15:55.240
Ask sensible questions about Kundalini and things,

01:15:55.440 --> 01:15:58.985
because the other day, one of the fellow was just on a quarrelling mood.

01:15:59.185 --> 01:16:03.077
So, please ask Me sensible questions if you want to know something

01:16:03.277 --> 01:16:06.530
and after that, we’ll have a session of Realization.

01:16:06.730 --> 01:16:10.707
And I’m sure most of you will get your Realization.

01:16:10.907 --> 01:16:16.814
Today is my last day here, but I’ll be coming back again in June.

01:16:17.014 --> 01:16:20.010
I’ll be here I think, on what days?

01:16:20.210 --> 01:16:24.682
I think 8 and 9, they have fixed my programs in some halls.

01:16:24.882 --> 01:16:28.627
Yogini: 25 and 26, 25 and 26.

01:16:28.827 --> 01:16:31.160
Shri Mataji: 20? Yogini: 25 and 26.

01:16:31.361 --> 01:16:36.263
Shri Mataji: 25 and 26 of June, I’ll be here.

01:16:36.463 --> 01:16:40.857
25 and 26 of June and you should also take the address of our centre.

01:16:41.057 --> 01:16:45.533
You can telephone and found out.

01:17:48.272 --> 01:17:53.533
Now, I would like to have some questions from you. Yes, sir.

01:17:53.733 --> 01:18:03.289
[If the spine is not straight due to some sickness like this, can the energy flow?]

01:18:03.490 --> 01:18:04.308
What did he say?

01:18:04.509 --> 01:18:06.849
[If the spine is not straight

01:18:07.050 --> 01:18:11.657
due to some either illness or accident, can the energy flow?]

01:18:11.858 --> 01:18:15.296
Yes, it can. It can flow, not only that

01:18:15.497 --> 01:18:19.803
but that sickness can also go.

01:18:59.424 --> 01:19:04.372
[It is said that a satguru can control the Kundalini from a distance.]

01:19:04.572 --> 01:19:07.263
Yes.

01:19:07.463 --> 01:19:11.494
But for that, you’d better see.

01:19:20.096 --> 01:19:25.490
[In India, a man in Hyderabad, I saw one guru take someone,

01:19:25.690 --> 01:19:30.066
he pushes his head, he disturbed the flow of blood,

01:19:30.266 --> 01:19:35.845
then the man falls down but after the energy came. What is this?]

01:19:36.045 --> 01:19:39.251
All non-sense.

01:19:39.451 --> 01:19:45.116
No, they have done. We had, you see, we had Kabir Das

01:19:45.316 --> 01:19:49.608
and Guru Nanak who have written chapters and chapters against this.

01:19:49.808 --> 01:19:53.310
Kabir Das has slashed this cheater and all that.

01:19:53.510 --> 01:19:56.400
But you see, nobody reads them, that’s the problem,

01:19:56.600 --> 01:20:00.761
nobody reads the real people! That’s the trouble is, you read Rajneesh,

01:20:00.961 --> 01:20:06.547
you read this and that, all absurd stuff. What to do?

01:21:09.229 --> 01:21:15.244
Actually, the awakening of the Kundalini cures your diseases.

01:21:15.444 --> 01:21:20.916
We have cured a person suffering from Aids, you’ll be surprised.

01:21:21.116 --> 01:21:23.195
An Aids fellow who came, he got cured.

01:21:23.395 --> 01:21:26.859
But again he went to something nonsensical habit

01:21:27.059 --> 01:21:29.968
and he got it back again but he was cured for two years.

01:21:30.168 --> 01:21:34.513
Cancer can be cured, most of the incurable diseases can be cured,

01:21:34.713 --> 01:21:39.316
madness can be cured. Not only that, but you get such

01:21:39.517 --> 01:21:43.464
a powerful personality that you give up all your habits,

01:21:43.664 --> 01:21:47.090
all your addictions, everything just drops out.

01:21:47.290 --> 01:21:51.504
I don’t say: "Don’t do that.” I say: "All right, you get your awakening.”

01:21:51.704 --> 01:21:57.870
It’s like the snake you see, those things and you just drops that.

01:23:12.140 --> 01:23:14.924
It is actually three and a half coils

01:23:15.124 --> 01:23:21.469
and the three coils are, the first one is the power of our desire

01:23:21.669 --> 01:23:25.573
through which we desire things. And then, after Realization,

01:23:25.778 --> 01:23:31.428
we desire whatever is good for our Spirit.

01:23:31.628 --> 01:23:35.514
Then we have the second power of our action

01:23:35.714 --> 01:23:42.832
which, when enlightened, we do the action which is dear to our Lord,

01:23:43.032 --> 01:23:48.323
God All-mighty. And the third one is the evolutionary power,

01:23:48.523 --> 01:23:54.953
which gives us, empowers us that we evolve others, we give Realization to others.

01:23:55.153 --> 01:24:00.618
The fourth one is the integrated power of the Holy Ghost, Adi Shakti,

01:24:00.818 --> 01:24:05.488
buy which it understands, it knows, it loves

01:24:05.688 --> 01:24:13.037
and it organizes and works out. It’s such a tremendous thing!

01:25:44.163 --> 01:25:48.299
Seeker: This is just a personal note. I spent a lot of time

01:25:48.499 --> 01:25:50.835
with Dany and Marcha and Bala. Shri Mataji: That’s great!

01:25:51.036 --> 01:25:54.995
Seeker: In San Francisco. Shri Mataji: Oh good, nice to see you.

01:25:55.195 --> 01:25:59.722
Seeker: I have never met thrilled people that were involved

01:25:59.922 --> 01:26:06.612
in a spiritual program that had so much to offer,

01:26:06.813 --> 01:26:09.680
feeling within themselves without even speaking

01:26:09.880 --> 01:26:12.120
and transmitting it to anyone that came to them.

01:26:12.320 --> 01:26:15.636
Shri Mataji: Dany is such a great soul. He’s such a great soul

01:26:15.836 --> 01:26:20.859
and he’s such a seeker. Because when I met him first,

01:26:21.059 --> 01:26:23.953
I met him in Bristol and then he got,

01:26:24.153 --> 01:26:27.617
he said: "Mother, what am I doing here?” I said: "Why?”

01:26:27.817 --> 01:26:31.566
He said: "I’m coming with You, I’m for God.”

01:26:31.766 --> 01:26:34.571
Just he and his wife, both of them came.

01:26:34.772 --> 01:26:38.525
And now he’s gone to America, he’s working for America.

01:26:38.726 --> 01:26:42.111
He is so much worried about American problems.

01:26:42.311 --> 01:26:50.331
Yes, it’s true. She’s seeing that, that’s very fine. Nice to hear about him.

01:28:03.924 --> 01:28:09.737
But the best part, another one I’ll tell you, is that with this ascent,

01:28:09.937 --> 01:28:13.328
financially you improve also very much like Dany’s case.

01:28:13.528 --> 01:28:17.289
He was in a bad shape. And we have somebody else here

01:28:17.489 --> 01:28:23.021
who was just in a very bad shape. And he brought one chip,

01:28:23.221 --> 01:28:25.974
memory chip to Me and he said he is doing for a project

01:28:26.174 --> 01:28:30.496
he wants to write a, he wants to achieve an experiment

01:28:30.696 --> 01:28:35.199
by which he can produce these new types of computers.

01:28:35.399 --> 01:28:39.517
I said: "All right, it can be done.” And today he’s a rich man.

01:28:39.717 --> 01:28:43.368
He’s got a big factory and all that. We have so many cases like that

01:28:43.568 --> 01:28:46.562
because you become so dynamic: the blessings of God.

01:28:46.762 --> 01:28:50.257
As Krishna has said that: "Yoga kshema vahaamyaham.”

01:28:50.457 --> 01:28:58.361
First, you get your yoga and then He looks after your wellbeing, not before, after.

01:30:00.056 --> 01:30:02.438
Yoga Kshema.

01:30:17.842 --> 01:30:20.697
There are, you’ll be happy to know there are two ladies

01:30:20.897 --> 01:30:26.683
who have come all the way from America to help the people in Paris.

01:30:26.883 --> 01:30:32.117
Will you stand up? We have two of them here. Have they come?

01:30:32.318 --> 01:30:37.634
They are there, see. They have come and they are there.

01:30:44.140 --> 01:30:47.561
Please be seated.

01:30:56.171 --> 01:31:00.763
Now, you have to go to America to help them out.

01:31:07.224 --> 01:31:12.643
We are importing people in Paris it’s not very good.

01:31:18.008 --> 01:31:20.941
What’s it? What the gentleman is trying to ask?

01:31:21.141 --> 01:31:23.785
All right, this is the last question now, all right?

01:31:23.985 --> 01:31:28.645
They are all anxious to have their Realization.

01:31:44.859 --> 01:31:50.946
[General anaesthesia, if somebody has to go for an important operation,

01:31:51.146 --> 01:31:55.649
general anaesthesia, what sort of effects does it have on the body,

01:31:55.849 --> 01:31:58.086
on the spiritual and the Kundalini?]

01:31:58.286 --> 01:32:02.437
General anaesthesia for a short time is all right it passes out,

01:32:02.637 --> 01:32:08.583
it doesn’t have much effect on the Kundalini as such. But after Realization you don’t get sick,

01:32:08.783 --> 01:32:12.396
so you don’t take any general anaesthesia, no operation, nothing,

01:32:12.596 --> 01:32:17.580
no more doctors.

01:32:44.738 --> 01:32:46.858
But if you use too much of anaesthesia

01:32:47.058 --> 01:32:51.913
or you’re becoming a person in charge of anaesthesia,

01:32:52.113 --> 01:32:54.633
then you do have left side tendencies

01:32:54.834 --> 01:32:59.123
which can be corrected of course.

01:33:25.790 --> 01:33:31.329
Just one more question he said. Now, all right, let it be the last.

01:33:31.735 --> 01:33:34.915
What is it?

01:33:45.232 --> 01:33:47.232
What did he say?

01:33:49.036 --> 01:33:53.804
He said that Ramakrishna and Shri Ramana Maharshi died of cancer.

01:33:54.004 --> 01:33:57.800
Because you see, it’s all right they were Realized souls, no doubt,

01:33:58.000 --> 01:34:03.312
but they didn’t know how to cure that’s why I’ve come on this earth.

01:34:03.512 --> 01:34:05.440
They didn’t know how to use the vibrations,

01:34:05.641 --> 01:34:08.488
because they caught up with other people.

01:34:08.688 --> 01:34:14.129
That’s what we teach you in Sahaja Yoga is how to protect yourself.

01:34:44.118 --> 01:34:48.918
Even if you have yoga, that is the union, you must know the technic,

01:34:49.118 --> 01:34:54.446
the deftness, the yantra [unsure] as they call it in Sanskrit.

01:35:04.037 --> 01:35:06.863
All right? Is there somebody there, raise the hand?

01:35:07.063 --> 01:35:12.461
Yes, some. All right, that’s all. You have been [inaudible] ?

01:35:17.960 --> 01:35:19.960
What did he say?

01:35:20.161 --> 01:35:22.445
[Can one trust guru Maraji?]

01:35:22.645 --> 01:35:24.683
Who?

01:35:24.884 --> 01:35:29.253
No. It’s all right.

01:35:30.341 --> 01:35:36.531
You see, the one who is buying Roll Royce, what is there to tell?

01:35:36.731 --> 01:35:38.754
[Rajneesh has got 25 Roll Royces.]

01:35:38.955 --> 01:35:42.013
Ah, yes, imagine! And this fellow has fifteen houses.

01:35:42.213 --> 01:35:46.202
[Yes, and he gets inside and he sells it twice the price

01:35:46.402 --> 01:35:49.972
because he has brought his darshan inside.]

01:35:51.496 --> 01:35:56.160
I’ve been telling them, I said: "Use your brains!”

01:36:11.576 --> 01:36:15.587
[Can one get rid of the heaviness of sleep?]

01:36:15.787 --> 01:36:18.103
Yes! [The difficulty of waking up.]

01:36:18.303 --> 01:36:22.983
Yes, yes, yes. That’s the minimum.

01:36:28.393 --> 01:36:30.788
Yes, here it goes again.

01:36:31.023 --> 01:36:33.730
[Where is the Spirit while we sleep?]

01:36:33.931 --> 01:36:38.442
No, the Spirit stays where it lives. But when you sleep,

01:36:38.642 --> 01:36:43.857
your attention goes on to the left-hand side, into the subconscious.

01:36:44.057 --> 01:36:46.529
And then into the Collective Subconscious.

01:36:46.729 --> 01:36:52.089
But if you know the balanced way of life, then you wake up,

01:36:52.290 --> 01:36:57.235
when you have to wake up and you sleep when you have to sleep.

01:37:54.011 --> 01:37:57.175
All right, last.

01:38:05.653 --> 01:38:11.371
[One talks about a force coming down to awaken the Kundalini.]

01:38:11.572 --> 01:38:16.129
Shakti Power you call it. Nothing of the kind. It is not secure.

01:38:17.450 --> 01:38:19.578
You see, it is a new style of a –

01:38:19.778 --> 01:38:23.023
they have started a new word Shakti Power, there is nothing like that.

01:38:23.223 --> 01:38:27.018
Actually, the Kundalini is a, you have to see now,

01:38:27.218 --> 01:38:29.932
you have to place your hands like this towards Me

01:38:30.132 --> 01:38:32.640
and these are the centres which represent

01:38:32.840 --> 01:38:38.315
one two, three, four, five, six and seven centres on the left-hand side

01:38:38.515 --> 01:38:45.315
and seven on the right-hand side. And when you join them together, you form the spinal cord like this

01:38:45.515 --> 01:38:49.774
and in the centre is the Sushumna through which the Kundalini has to rise.

01:38:49.974 --> 01:38:52.368
Now, when you put your hands towards Me like this,

01:38:52.568 --> 01:38:56.029
what happens is that the vibrations flow through your hands

01:38:56.229 --> 01:39:00.498
and inform the Kundalini and that’s how the Kundalini is awakened.

01:39:00.698 --> 01:39:03.427
There’s nothing like something coming down upon you and all that.

01:39:03.627 --> 01:39:07.419
It’s all the new stuff they have started. Actually, they mesmerize you

01:39:07.619 --> 01:39:11.643
with some spirits and with that kind of a thing like Shakti path business.

01:39:11.843 --> 01:39:15.776
It is never good. I’ve seen people start screaming, shouting,

01:39:15.976 --> 01:39:19.786
and making all kinds of noise and all that. It’s all absurd!

01:39:19.987 --> 01:39:23.602
Somebody has written a book called [?] that we have had told yesterday

01:39:23.802 --> 01:39:26.880
that it is written in that, when it happens, sometimes you start

01:39:27.080 --> 01:39:30.514
jumping like a frog. Now use your brains, really.

01:39:30.714 --> 01:39:36.151
Are we going to be frogs now? Or like worms?

01:39:36.844 --> 01:39:39.848
Yesterday I said it.

01:41:05.042 --> 01:41:09.080
All right now. Now, how many...

01:41:20.928 --> 01:41:23.822
[At what age can we start Kundalini awakening?

01:41:24.022 --> 01:41:28.084
From what age can we start the Kundalini awaekening?]

01:41:29.952 --> 01:41:36.395
There’s no minima, in a second, a split of a second.

01:41:42.494 --> 01:41:49.995
Just now. It is a, once there’s a great guru in India,

01:41:50.195 --> 01:41:54.822
Ramdas was the guru of Shivaji king, and he was asked:

01:41:55.023 --> 01:41:59.142
"How much time it will take for us to raise our Kundalini

01:41:59.342 --> 01:42:02.718
to get our Realization?” He used the word: "Tatkshane”,

01:42:02.919 --> 01:42:08.894
that’s the moment. A split of a second.

01:42:33.990 --> 01:42:40.347
Let’s have it now because you have asked too many questions I think.

01:42:43.035 --> 01:42:46.872
Let us see how many of you will get Realization

01:42:47.072 --> 01:42:54.250
and after Realization, rise and establish your Realization.

01:43:14.980 --> 01:43:19.590
Now, the second thing has to be done that you have to take out

01:43:19.790 --> 01:43:26.720
your shoes to touch the Mother Earth. It helps us a lot to touch the Mother.

01:43:40.474 --> 01:43:44.243
Also, you have to take out your spectacles

01:43:44.443 --> 01:43:50.386
because you have to keep your eyes shut all the time.

01:44:02.990 --> 01:44:07.772
And you have to be in a pleasant mood,

01:44:09.538 --> 01:44:14.744
because you are going to enter into the kingdom of God.

01:44:16.361 --> 01:44:20.813
It has been your desire for ages.

01:44:25.063 --> 01:44:28.263
If you have anything very tied here or tied here,

01:44:28.490 --> 01:44:35.718
you can loosen it a little bit because it might a little bit disturb your attention.

01:44:50.827 --> 01:44:54.323
As the left-side is the power of desire, you have to put the left hand

01:44:54.531 --> 01:44:58.211
like this on your lap in a very relaxed manner,

01:44:58.412 --> 01:45:04.055
in a very relaxed manner. Be positive, first of all, be positive.

01:45:26.436 --> 01:45:29.673
With the right-hand, you have to use the action,

01:45:29.873 --> 01:45:35.232
because you are going to awaken your Kundalini.
